  "edits": [
    {
      "id": "A39476-zh-00001",
      "source_hash": "cb15edc966821694d4901c1745ded3f79252d5ddcb2f0d429e8268b078f65a63",
      "text": "■ 《防止人口贩运等及保护受害者等法施行令》〔附表三〕"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39476-zh-00004",
      "source_hash": "d5b008c3792c5eaca47932dbcc46e67685ef2fd855e67a049310b239538ee20a",
      "text": "支援设施应当具备下列各项设备。但在不得已的情况下，乙、"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39476-zh-00005",
      "source_hash": "cfcaa8ec82ccd98b38b419688bc90f4f9bd73c8c3ce3b5cce201863b03bfc63f",
      "text": "丙、丁项所列设备可以共用，或者己、庚、辛项所列设备可以共用。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39476-zh-00007",
      "source_hash": "8de451f851ed8ca46a728bfb4718f18f68708f5e70a86579cbf7a3caebd417b7",
      "text": "甲. 卧室及起居室"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39476-zh-00011",
      "source_hash": "fea12249bf23dcfcadffe538ebd7a4c9ba2723f3401a16c7ac091ff99050ad30",
      "text": "3）除走廊等公共区域以外，卧室及起居室的实际面积应达到每名入住者6.6"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39476-zh-00012",
      "source_hash": "1da9b1bcaa758e83f4a02f066188e9376b21cfe245a30cd0f45beb69222f4e71",
      "text": "平方米以上，且每间卧室入住人数不得超过四人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39476-zh-00013",
      "source_hash": "f94faa2f74ea2310eea4e29af9d8f6f6cab08e2f75fbe96c1a1fbf8208cbd3f0",
      "text": "乙. 办公室"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39476-zh-00015",
      "source_hash": "1f4374287898e406cda8d0c1f1dbe5f108629961a7dfb0b6e25ac7e9582afb15",
      "text": "丙. 咨询室"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39476-zh-00017",
      "source_hash": "6b4d3ab3a1260615b73facc7654d315f64a29d3f4aa942b115710d708fa4f601",
      "text": "丁. 值班室"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39476-zh-00019",
      "source_hash": "398bf7a0d336744b952ac71fd68abee2b5a2e8ea7c4ca311b7a18ff1df7ca31b",
      "text": "戊. 餐厅及烹饪室"
    },
    {
      "id": "A39476-zh-00021",
      "source_hash": "749f04c26de62feff3ae9ebafa2f3b27c0368ef9d8c4a10599767e8f7d68ea7c",
      "text": "己. 浴室"
    }
  ],
  "note": "Reviewed first 22 rows of support facility designation standards against Korean source. Corrected decree title, shared room categories, sleeping room minimum 6.6 square meters per resident and four-person capacity, and facility category headings. Other 11 rows retained."
